# The band state: AB supplies the trousers, and this mod's own art options are both switched OFF by
# a settings seed (config/wdi-ab-band/), so the mod registers no texture and makes no pattern def
# and TailorMade fits AB's plain shell into the band and answers the pants slider as it always did.
# It is the state a player gets who turns both options off, and the only one in which the band this
# mod exists to adjust is what is drawn. Select it with
# `Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -DepMap wsl-deps.wdi-ab-band.map -Filter 'TailorMade Waistlines - Pickle tests,!@native-art'`:
# the scenarios tagged @native-art assert the opposite state and go red here by design.
# One line per mod: packageId then its Workshop id.
wdi.realistic.bodies   3527486510
ab.vplrf               2986402536

# The inspect-tab steps 02-gear-tab.feature needs, as a PickleTools package on the stock Pickle.
nelim.pickletools.inspecttabs   path:PickleTools/InspectTabs/Mod

# The body-type step 03-silhouettes.feature needs ("Nelim's Pickle Tools: <pawn> body type is <word>"), as a PickleTools
# package on the stock Pickle, the same route as the inspect tabs above. Needs Biotech for genes.
nelim.pickletools.colonistrace   path:PickleTools/ColonistRace/Mod
